## How to Determine Your Hectares

If you are unsure whether you exceed 1,000 hectares:

1. Sum the area of all fields you manage (owned + leased)
2. Include fields managed on behalf of other organizations
3. Round up to the nearest hectare
4. If total ≥ 1,001 ha → Commercial License required

**Note:** Field Mapper includes an automatic hectares calculation.
Organizations approaching the threshold will be notified proactively.
